        {
          "id": 2477003587,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, the first two are tolerant of unknown arguments, they let the third one handle it.\n\nThere are some tricky timing issues with command line arguments that change preferences that can then change settings that can change other command line arguments, etc.",
